    {
      "kind": "other",
      "path": [
        "Rewards",
        "Main Story"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "During the event, once the player logs into Duel Links for the first time since the event started (or if they were already logged-in at the time, then immediately when they entered one of the four Duel World outdoor locations, if they weren't at one already), they will be greeted by Tristan Taylor.",
        "* Bastion Misawa: One two draw! One two draw!",
        "* Syrus Truesdale: \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026 Bastion, what are you doing?",
        "* Bastion Misawa: Can't you tell? I'm practicing my draw!",
        "* Syrus Truesdale: Okay, yeah\u2026 But why?",
        "* Bastion Misawa: I've constructed a new deck just for this world. And this is my final training before battle!",
        "* Syrus Truesdale: Oh.",
        "* Bastion Misawa: A Logic Deck + Miracle Draw = my Complete Unified Theory of Dueling! I've finished building my Logic Deck, so only my Miracle Draw remains. However\u2026 It's not easy to pull off, So I must practice to improve my draw!",
        "* Syrus Truesdale: (I don't think ANY amount of practice can help your draw\u2026)",
        "* Bastion Misawa: I'm ready! Allow me test my skills in battle! With my Unified Theory of Dueling, I will once again be the top Duelist! Yeahhhhhhhhhhhhh!",
        "* Syrus Truesdale: Hey! Why did you just run off? Bastiooooon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "other",
      "path": [
        "Rewards",
        "Duel Dialogues"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "These dialogues are exclusive to Inglorious Bastion during this event:",
        "Pre-Duel:",
        "* Bastion Misawa: My Unified Theory of Dueling will put me back in the spotlight!",
        "Player Win:",
        "* Bastion Misawa: My deck wasn't logical, nor my draw was miraculous! Am I a failure?",
        "Player Loss:",
        "* Bastion Misawa: I'm one step closer to my Unified Dueling Theory! The universe will marvel at my discovery!",
        "Draw:",
        "* Bastion Misawa: When will it be my time to shine?!?"
      ]
    }
  ],
